cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Face_sys_LFW: Face Verification and Identification on LFW"
abstract: >-
  A face verification and identification pipeline built on a pretrained OpenFace
  nn4.small2 embedding network, evaluated on the Labeled Faces in the Wild (LFW)
  dataset. The project measures verification (1-to-1) and rank-1 identification
  (1-to-N) separately, and quantifies the effect of face cropping on both.
authors:
